triage:ninja-1.13.2
    a triage:Statement ;
    vex:product <pkg:nix/ninja@1.13.2> ;
    vex:vulnerability nvd:CVE-2021-4336 ;
    vex:status "not_affected" ;
    vex:justification "component_not_present" ;
    vex:statusNotes """
        NVD CPE false positive: CVE-2021-4336 is an SQL injection in ITRS Group's monitor-ninja, a PHP monitoring web app, affected before 2021.11.30.
        It is unrelated to the Ninja build system. vulnix reads 1.13.2 as lower than that date.
        On framework-13 it is reached only through open-webui and python3.14-torch.
        """ .

