triage:libsndfile-1.2.2-patched
    a triage:Statement ;
    vex:product <pkg:nix/libsndfile@1.2.2> ;
    vex:vulnerability nvd:CVE-2024-50612 , nvd:CVE-2026-37555 ;
    vex:status "fixed" ;
    vex:statusNotes """
        Nixpkgs patches both, from commit 91d5f8b: CVE-2024-50612 (vorbis_analysis_wrote out-of-bounds read, upstream PR 1045) and CVE-2026-37555 (IMA ADPCM integer overflow on the WAV and close paths, upstream PR 1123) carry named CVE patches in libsndfile.patches. vulnix can't see that because the version string is unchanged.
